  "bio": "Nestled in the vibrant heart of Austin, Bart Willis Tattoo Studio is a creative hub where the ink comes to life in illustrative, traditional, and Japanese styles. Operating seven days a week, the studio thrives on the expertise of its resident artists, including the likes of @bartwillistattoo and @noskachickatello, ensuring that every piece crafted within its walls is a unique masterpiece. Walk-ins are welcomed into a space where passion for the art form meets a laid-back Texan charm.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Austin, Texas, United States"
